    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with a Builder drafting a comprehensive localization strategy. A Cross-Market Refiner then deepens the analysis before a While-loop Strategic Depth Validator iteratively validates local specificity and core-vs-local balance, looping back to the Refiner up to three times. An EdTech Localization Expert then injects ground-truth regulatory and cultural reality checks. An Expert Integration Refiner incorporates this feedback, followed by an If-gate Final Quality Check that either approves the document or routes it back to the Integration Refiner for last-mile fixes. Finally, an Executive Polisher formats the output into a board-ready strategy document. This architecture balances creative drafting, iterative depth, expert validation, and final polish within a fully automated flow."
